    {
      "id": "HYL-P2-SPEECH-001",
      "domain": "speech-and-multimodal-systems",
      "principle": "語音／多模態系統要先釐清每個 modality 的資訊路徑與 cascade boundary，再比較 ASR→LLM→TTS、speech-to-speech 或 representation-transfer recipe 的錯誤傳播與成本。",
      "decision_rule": "對每個 modality 分別記錄 input quality、transcription/recognition error、semantic task score、prosody/voice quality 和 latency；用 matched examples 比較 cascade 與 end-to-end 設計，並切分出聲音、文字與跨模態失敗。",
      "evidence_level": "CROSS_SOURCE_INFERENCE",
      "uncertainty": "來源包含 speech self-supervision、speech-language systems 與生成應用；不構成對端到端或 cascade 的普遍性能結論。",
